     "titulo": "Interpretation with evidence",
     "texto": [
      "**Το έργο υποδηλώνει…** states an interpretation; **η λεπτομέρεια αυτή παραπέμπει σε…** links it to a piece of evidence. **Θα μπορούσε να…** keeps the reading open.",
      "Notice what relationship each connector sets up and use it to express your own position."
     ],
